# A Sprint-V "keep it just in case" snapshot of the 19 plugins that existed then
# — 970 files, 69 MB.
#
# Ignored rather than deleted: the history of every file in it is already in git
# under the file's own path, so the copy holds nothing that is not recoverable,
# and leaving it on disk costs only space.
#
# Ignored rather than tracked: it holds 19 shadow `.claude-plugin/plugin.json`
# manifests, and 15 skill/command files whose frontmatter was repaired in the
# live tree and is still unparseable in the copy. A stray `git add` would bring
# those shadow manifests into the catalog, where a gate or a reader that opens
# the wrong copy reports a plugin state that stopped being true in Sprint V.
#
# The three tracked files one level up — README.md, agent.md, protocol.json —
# are the part of the archive that is meant to be kept, and stay tracked.
agents/_archive/discover-pre-sprint-v/plugins/
